# rms/ — resource management system stories

This directory is the canonical feature-story home for resource-management behavior. It inherits
the parent a2o story-review gate. Keep filesystem references system-scoped (`features/rms/`) while
retaining pillar vocabulary where the scenario actually names the Shefa product surface.
